value.indirectResReduction.3=33%
value.indirectResReduction.4=25%
option.ssptSPP=Samples per Pixel
option.ssptSPP.comment=Paths traced per pixel per frame. More samples = less noise, more cost.
option.ssptBounces=Bounces
option.ssptBounces.comment=Path bounces per sample. More bounces = more colored light bleed.
option.ssptEmissionDistance=Emission Distance
option.ssptEmissionDistance.comment=How far colored emission carries before fading out (blocks).
option.ssptLightmapBlend=Lightmap Blending
option.ssptLightmapBlend.comment=How strongly the vanilla lightmap blocklight blends into the SSPT accumulation.
option.SSPT_INTENSITY=SSPT Intensity
option.SSPT_INTENSITY.comment=Global brightness multiplier for the SSPT indirect emission contribution.
option.FRAMING_TOOL=Framing Tool
option.FRAMING_TOOL.comment=Master toggle for composition guides (rule-of-thirds, aspect box, safe area). For lining up screenshots.
option.FRAMING_THIRDS=Thirds Grid
option.FRAMING_THIRDS.comment=Rule-of-thirds grid overlay.
option.FRAMING_ASPECT=Aspect Guides
option.FRAMING_ASPECT.comment=Target aspect-ratio box and safe-area guides.
option.FRAMING_OPACITY=Guide Opacity
option.FRAMING_OPACITY.comment=Guide line opacity.
option.FRAMING_LINE_WIDTH=Line Width
option.FRAMING_LINE_WIDTH.comment=Guide line thickness in pixels.
option.FRAMING_ASPECT_RATIO=Aspect Ratio
option.FRAMING_ASPECT_RATIO.comment=Target aspect ratio (width over height) for the crop box.
option.FRAMING_SAFE_AREA=Safe Area
option.FRAMING_SAFE_AREA.comment=Centered safe-area fraction shown inside the aspect box.
option.maxFrames=Max Accumulated Frames
option.maxFrames.comment=Temporal history length. Higher = smoother, but more ghosting.
option.minAccumMult=Accumulation Weight Mult
option.minAccumMult.comment=Minimum blend weight per frame. Higher = reacts faster, noisier.
option.ADAPT_STRENGTH=Adaptive Strength
option.ADAPT_STRENGTH.comment=How quickly history is discarded when the lightmap changes.
option.SVGF_FILTER=Filtering
option.SVGF_FILTER.comment=SVGF a-trous filter: removes the remaining SSPT noise edge-aware.
option.SVGF_RAD=Filter Radius
option.SVGF_RAD.comment=Tap radius of each a-trous filter iteration.
option.SVGF_STRICTNESS=Luminance Strictness
option.SVGF_STRICTNESS.comment=How aggressively the filter preserves brightness differences.
option.SVGF_NORMALEXP=Normal Weight
option.SVGF_NORMALEXP.comment=How strongly surface normal differences block filtering across edges.

option.FOG_SMOOTHING=Fog Smoothing
option.FOG_SMOOTHING.comment = Edge-aware blur on the fog buffer against blocky artifacts. Current-frame only, so no smearing on fast movement. Cheap.
option.FOG_SMOOTHING_RADIUS=Fog Blur Radius
option.FOG_SMOOTHING_RADIUS.comment = Fog blur radius. Higher is softer at higher cost, while respecting hard density edges.
option.NETHER_SMOKE=Nether Smoke
option.NETHER_SMOKE.comment = Turbulent Nether smoke replacing the flat fog glow, with ember-bright proximity glow. Falls back to classic fog when off.
option.NETHER_SMOKE_INTENSITY=Nether Smoke Intensity
option.NETHER_SMOKE_INTENSITY.comment = Brightness multiplier for the Nether Smoke v2 glow/emission. Only has an effect when Nether Smoke is enabled.



